## 1.1 Current State Assessment

**Vấn đề với data hiện tại:**
- 162 motifs (9 urns × 18 motifs/urn)
- `description_short` và `description_educational` **gần như giống nhau** (copy-paste)
- `quiz_question` chỉ có **1 câu hỏi/motif** với format đơn giản
- Thiếu: `historical_context`, `symbolism`, `fun_fact`, `name_en`
- Quiz questions quá dễ (đáp án luôn là option A)

**DB Schema đã sẵn sàng:**
- `LessonContent`: có đầy đủ fields nhưng chưa được populate
- `QuizQuestion`: hỗ trợ nhiều question types nhưng chỉ dùng `multiple_choice`

## 1.2 Requirements (EARS Notation)

### Content Enrichment Requirements

| ID | Requirement |
|----|-------------|
| **REQ-CE-01** | WHEN an admin wants to enrich motif content THE SYSTEM SHALL support updated JSON data files with expanded lesson content fields (historical_context, symbolism, fun_fact, name_en) |
| **REQ-CE-02** | WHEN seed.py runs with enriched data THE SYSTEM SHALL update LessonContent records with all new fields |
| **REQ-CE-03** | WHEN each motif is seeded THE SYSTEM SHALL have at least 3-5 quiz questions with varying difficulty (1-3) |
| **REQ-CE-04** | WHEN quiz questions are created THE SYSTEM SHALL use diverse question types (multiple_choice, true_false, image_select) |
| **REQ-CE-05** | WHEN a user views a motif lesson THE SYSTEM SHALL display enriched content including historical context, symbolism, and fun facts |
| **REQ-CE-06** | WHEN content is AI-generated THE SYSTEM SHALL mark it with `is_ai_generated=true` flag |

### Data Quality Requirements

| ID | Requirement |
|----|-------------|
| **REQ-DQ-01** | WHEN motif content is created THE SYSTEM SHALL ensure description_educational is minimum 200 words |
| **REQ-DQ-02** | WHEN quiz options are created THE SYSTEM SHALL randomize correct answer position (not always option A) |
| **REQ-DQ-03** | WHEN motif names exist THE SYSTEM SHALL have English translations (name_en) |
| **REQ-DQ-04** | WHEN motif categories are assigned THE SYSTEM SHALL use correct category (not all thao_moc) |

