# Enriched JSON Schema for Motif Data

## Overview

This document defines the enhanced JSON structure for motif data in the Lưu Niên Sử Kí LMS project. The enriched schema adds educational content, historical context, cultural symbolism, and multiple quiz questions to each motif.

## Schema Structure

```json
{
  "id": "string",
  "name_vi": "string",
  "name_en": "string",
  "urn_location": "string",
  "category": "enum",
  "rarity": "enum",

  "description_short": "string",
  "description_educational": "string",
  "historical_context": "string",
  "symbolism": "string",
  "fun_fact": "string",

  "is_ai_generated": "boolean",

  "quiz_questions": [
    {
      "type": "enum",
      "question": "string",
      "options": ["string"],
      "correct_answer": "string",
      "difficulty": "integer",
      "explanation": "string"
    }
  ],

  "3d_mesh_id": "string",
  "thumbnail_url": "string"
}
```

## Field Definitions

### Core Fields

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `id` | string | ✅ | Unique identifier (e.g., "urn_cao_dinh_02") |
| `name_vi` | string | ✅ | Vietnamese name |
| `name_en` | string | ✅ | English translation |
| `urn_location` | string | ✅ | Which urn this motif belongs to |
| `category` | enum | ✅ | Motif category (see Categories section) |
| `rarity` | enum | ✅ | Rarity level (see Rarity section) |

### Content Fields

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `description_short` | string | ✅ | Brief 1-2 sentence description |
| `description_educational` | string | ✅ | Detailed educational content (200+ words) |
| `historical_context` | string | ⭐ NEW | Historical background and significance |
| `symbolism` | string | ⭐ NEW | Cultural and symbolic meaning |
| `fun_fact` | string | ⭐ NEW | Interesting trivia or lesser-known facts |
| `is_ai_generated` | boolean | ⭐ NEW | Flag for AI-generated content (default: false) |

### Quiz Questions

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `quiz_questions` | array | ⭐ NEW | Array of 3-5 quiz questions |
| `quiz_questions[].type` | enum | ✅ | Question type (see Question Types) |
| `quiz_questions[].question` | string | ✅ | Question text |
| `quiz_questions[].options` | array | ⚠️ | Answer options (required for multiple_choice) |
| `quiz_questions[].correct_answer` | string | ✅ | Correct answer |
| `quiz_questions[].difficulty` | integer | ✅ | Difficulty level (1-3) |
| `quiz_questions[].explanation` | string | ⭐ NEW | Explanation of the correct answer |

### Media Fields

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `3d_mesh_id` | string | ✅ | 3D mesh identifier |
| `thumbnail_url` | string | ✅ | Thumbnail image path |

## Enums

### Categories

```javascript
"linh_thu"      // Linh thú (mythical creatures: dragon, phoenix, qilin)
"dong_vat"      // Động vật (animals: tiger, elephant, fish)
"thao_moc"      // Thảo mộc (plants: flowers, trees, fruits)
"dia_ly"        // Địa lý (geography: rivers, mountains, seas)
"nong_nghiep"   // Nông nghiệp (agriculture: rice, plow, boat)
"vo_bi"         // Vũ khí (weapons: sword, spear, bow)
"giao_thuong"   // Giao thương (trade: merchant ships, coins)
"thien_van"     // Thiên văn (astronomy: sun, moon, stars)
"kien_truc"     // Kiến trúc (architecture: palaces, temples)
```

### Rarity Levels

```javascript
"common"        // Phổ biến - Common motifs
"uncommon"      // Ít gặp - Less common
"rare"          // Hiếm - Rare motifs
"epic"          // Sử thi - Epic significance
"legendary"     // Huyền thoại - Legendary importance
```

### Question Types

```javascript
"multiple_choice"  // Multiple choice with 4 options (A, B, C, D)
"true_false"       // True/False question
"image_select"     // Select from image options
"mesh_location"    // Identify location on 3D mesh
```

